{"speciesId":611,"names":{"fr":"Incisache","es":"Fraxure","en":"Fraxure","ja":"オノンド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Comme ses crocs brisés ne repoussent pas, il les aiguise après le combat grâce à une pierre ramassée près d’un fleuve."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Since a broken tusk will not grow back, they diligently sharpen their tusks on river rocks after they’ve been fighting."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Leurs crocs peuvent découper des rochers. Leurs querelles de territoire sont extrêmement violentes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Their tusks can shatter rocks. Territory battles between Fraxure can be intensely violent."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Leurs crocs peuvent découper des rochers. Leurs querelles de territoire sont extrêmement violentes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus colmillos pueden hacer añicos rocas inmensas. Las luchas territoriales de los Fraxure son encarnizadas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Their tusks can shatter rocks. Territory battles between Fraxure can be intensely violent."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大岩を 砕く キバを 持つ。 縄張りを 巡る オノンドたちの 争いは 非常に 激しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Comme ses crocs brisés ne repoussent pas, il les aiguise avec soin après le combat sur les pierres des rivières."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus colmillos no vuelven a crecer, por lo que, al término de cada combate, los afila cuidadosamente con cantos de río."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"キバは 二度と 生え変わらないので 戦い終わると 川原の 岩を 使って 丹念に 磨きあげる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Leurs crocs peuvent découper des rochers. Leurs querelles de territoire sont extrêmement violentes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sus colmillos pueden hacer añicos rocas inmensas. Las luchas territoriales de los Fraxure son encarnizadas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Their tusks can shatter rocks. Territory battles between Fraxure can be intensely violent."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大岩を 砕く キバを 持つ。 縄張りを 巡る オノンドたちの 争いは 非常に 激しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Comme ses crocs brisés ne repoussent pas, il les aiguise avec soin après le combat sur les pierres des rivières."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus colmillos no vuelven a crecer, por lo que, al término de cada combate, los afila cuidadosamente con cantos de río."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"キバは 二度と 生え変わらないので 戦い終わると 川原の 岩を 使って 丹念に 磨きあげる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Une fois cassés, ses crocs ne repoussent pas. Après les combats, il les aiguise avec soin sur les pierres d’un ruisseau."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sus colmillos no vuelven a crecer, por lo que, al término de cada combate, los afila cuidadosamente con cantos de río."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After battle, this Pokémon carefully sharpens its tusks on river rocks. It needs to take care of its tusks—if one breaks, it will never grow back."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"キバは 折れると 二度と 生えない。 戦いが 終わると 河原の 岩で 丁寧に 研ぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Son épiderme est dur comme une armure. Il est passé maître dans l’art de charger l’ennemi tout en le transperçant de ses crocs."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su piel es dura como una coraza. Su técnica predilecta consiste en embestir al rival para hincarle los colmillos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its skin is as hard as a suit of armor. Fraxure’s favorite strategy is to tackle its opponents, stabbing them with its tusks at the same time."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"鎧の ように 硬い 皮膚。 体当たりと 同時に キバを 突き刺す 戦法が 得意 だぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":611,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"guillotine","learns":[[11,"level-up",54],[14,"level-up",54],[15,"level-up",54],[16,"level-up",54],[17,"level-up",54],[18,"level-up",54],[20,"level-up",51],[25,"level-up",51]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[11,"level-up",48],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",48],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",48],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",48],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",48],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",48],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",41],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",41],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25